DESCRIPTION:Davis Chinese Christian Church invites families in the church and wider community to a Children’s Ministry Fall Festival on Saturday\, November 7\, 2026\, from 4:00 to 6:00 p.m. at 536 Anderson Road\, Davis\, CA 95616. The event will feature activities for children\, followed by a potluck dinner in the church’s new fellowship hall. \nFamilies and community members are welcome to join in an afternoon of activities\, food\, and connection.
